WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
BUILD 061. A DECISION RECORD CAN LOSE ITS REASONS.

2
00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:10.000
PRESERVE EVIDENCE, ASSUMPTIONS, ALTERNATIVES, DISSENT, AUTHORITY, AND EXPECTED OUTCOMES.

3
00:00:10.000 --> 00:00:15.000
SEPARATE WHAT WAS KNOWN THEN FROM WHAT HINDSIGHT ADDS NOW.

4
00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:20.000
TRACE CHANGED SOURCES, ASSUMPTIONS, OUTCOMES, CONTRADICTIONS, GAPS, AND ATTRIBUTION.

5
00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:25.000
RECOVERY CANNOT ESTABLISH TRUTH, REASONABLENESS, LEGALITY, INTENT, OR ACCOUNTABILITY.

6
00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
KEEP THEN AND NOW DISTINCT. MAKE THE ORIGINAL DECISION REVIEWABLE.
